sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Agent
  participant G as ActionGate (kaiban-distributed)
  participant V as Carbon validator
  participant C as Governor core
  participant X as execute (governor/harness.js)
  participant H as Human approver
  participant L as Audit log

  A->>G: evaluate(action, estimated grams CO2e)
  G->>V: check(context)
  V->>C: decide(estimate)
  C-->>V: verdict + pacing ratio
  V-->>G: verdict
  G->>L: append hash-chained record
  G-->>A: most severe verdict wins
  A->>X: execute(decision, task, approval?)
  alt allow
    X->>X: run the action, commit the grams
  else degrade
    X->>X: run smaller now, or pause and run later at the cleanest slot
  else escalate
    X->>H: ask for approval
    H-->>X: approve or refuse
    X->>X: on approval, defer or run reduced
  else block
    X->>H: ask whether to authorise the reduced or deferred fallback
    H-->>X: approve or refuse
    X->>X: on approval, the fallback only - never the action as proposed
  else terminate
    X->>X: nothing runs, and no one is asked - not overridable
  end
